WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.638
Module 4: the migration sequence
and operating the control plane.

2
00:00:04.638 --> 00:00:08.771
Name resolution has to keep
working while its authority moves,

3
00:00:08.771 --> 00:00:12.110
so Chapter 10 makes the
migration a series of small,

4
00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:17.038
reversible cutovers, each proven from
every origin before the next starts.

5
00:00:17.038 --> 00:00:21.747
Chapter 11 then covers what the
plane must support once it exists:

6
00:00:21.747 --> 00:00:26.370
scoped autonomy for divisions, one
API and audit trail, the query,

7
00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:31.951
lease and change evidence that OMB M-26-14
and an authorizing official ask for,

8
00:00:31.951 --> 00:00:35.963
and a troubleshooting reference
for the hybrid period.

9
00:00:35.963 --> 00:00:38.793
Appendix A's record-type
catalog and Appendix

10
00:00:38.793 --> 00:00:41.690
B's requirements mapping
sit underneath both.
